# A pinned tab playing a video, then Add Split View (⌥Return in the command bar takes the same
# path): the split shows a Today copy of the page and the pinned tab sleeps, as in Arc. Before
# 4 Nov 2026 the pinned tab's video also opened in Picture in Picture, two videos at once
# (reported on X).
cra://open?url=file://${FIXTURES}/Pages/video.html
expect-log loaded file:
cra://action/pinTab
wait 1
# Auto Picture in Picture asks only for a playing video with sound.
cra://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"(v=>(v.muted=false,v.volume=1,v.play().then(()=>'playing:'+v.videoWidth)))(document.querySelector('video'))","awaitPromise":true,"userGesture":true}
expect-log Cra cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"playing:640"
cra://action/addSplitView
expect-log sleeps: its split copy shows the page
expect-log tab sleep discards.* file:
wait 2
reject-log enters Picture in Picture
